description: Homepage section placement and dark theme defaults
globs: app/page.tsx,components/home/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Homepage sections

- **Bottom placement:** New sections go last in `app/page.tsx` (above footer), not mid-page, unless the user specifies a position.
- **Dark theme:** `bg-surface-dark` + `text-primary-foreground`. Cards use `border-border-strong`, `bg-surface-elevated`, white/`white/60` text, primary hover — same as existing dark home sections.
- **Avoid** `bg-surface-warm`, white section backgrounds, or light-theme copy colors unless the user explicitly asks.
